WEBVTT

00:00:00.011 --> 00:00:04.617
Hi, I'm Paula and this is a short video about

00:00:04.618 --> 00:00:06.638
how BPlan DIY works.

00:00:07.843 --> 00:00:12.877
Most business plans use hard to complete templates and separate complicated

00:00:12.878 --> 00:00:17.467
spreadsheets. BPlan DIY builds your plan and your cash flow

00:00:17.468 --> 00:00:21.088
forecast at the same time in five simple steps.

00:00:22.133 --> 00:00:26.734
It's easy. We gather the information about your business and the market

00:00:26.735 --> 00:00:30.301
opportunity and consider your ambition.

00:00:31.261 --> 00:00:35.828
You can use AI to make suggestions and help you with how you're

00:00:35.829 --> 00:00:38.782
going to achieve your goals. Finally,

00:00:38.783 --> 00:00:43.495
you complete your cash flow forecast and see clearly how your business

00:00:43.496 --> 00:00:46.682
will achieve success. When you're happy,

00:00:46.683 --> 00:00:51.240
generate your business plan, which can be branded for your business and

00:00:51.241 --> 00:00:55.877
downloaded to Word. Use your plan to apply for bank or investor

00:00:55.878 --> 00:01:00.244
funding or to keep measuring your business success.

00:01:01.244 --> 00:01:03.747
So get started today. Thanks for listening.
